---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "Open source · Hufu",
  description: "Original Hufu code uses MIT. Dependencies retain their licenses; the Tiger-Code word lists ship under their official release terms.",
};
---

<Base locale="en" slug="open-source" title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <main id="main"><div class="page-content wrap"><div class="page-heading"><a class="back-link" href="/en/">Hufu home <span aria-hidden="true">/</span></a><h1>Code and dependencies, with sources.</h1><p>Original Hufu code uses MIT. Dependencies retain their licenses; the Tiger-Code word lists ship under their official release terms.</p></div><section class="open-intro prose"><h2>Hufu code and dependencies.</h2><p>Hufu is an independent macOS frontend based on librime, not a Squirrel fork. Original code uses MIT; librime, OpenCC and the Tiger-Code schema keep their own licenses.</p><div class="source-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu">GitHub · syhily/hufu <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">Vocabulary · hufu-dicts <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div><div class="code-block"><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/syhily/hufu.git</code></pre><button data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Hufu bundles no native plugins: librime and its dependencies are linked statically, and the installer contains no GPL component. The Tiger-Code word lists ship under their official release terms, and sources travel with each GitHub Release. does not make the whole installer MIT-only. Corresponding source is provided with each GitHub Release.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/blob/main/docs/license-packaging-verification.md">Third-party notices <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases">Releases &amp; corresponding source <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT license text <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div></section><div class="license-table"><div><strong>Hufu original code</strong><span>MIT</span><p>© 2026 syhily</p></div><div><strong>Project word lists</strong><span>CC BY 4.0</span><p>From the official Tiger-Code release 2026.08.15, used under its release terms</p></div><div><strong>Bundled third-party materials</strong><span>Original licenses by component</span><p>librime (BSD-3-Clause) and OpenCC (Apache-2.0)</p><p>leveldb / marisa-trie / yaml-cpp / Boost keep their own licences</p></div></div><p class="prose">This website renders with system fonts and loads no third-party font.</p><section class="prose"><h2>The open-source projects Hufu uses.</h2><p>These projects provide the foundation for the engine, word lists, conversion and configuration parsing. Names and trademarks belong to their owners; these credits imply no partnership or endorsement.</p><ul class="upstream-list"><li><a href="https://github.com/rime/librime">RIME / librime <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-3-Clause</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC">OpenCC <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>Apache-2.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/google/leveldb">leveldb <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-3-Clause</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/s-yata/marisa-trie">marisa-trie <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-2-Clause / LGPL-2.1</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/jbeder/yaml-cpp">yaml-cpp <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>MIT</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/boostorg/boost">Boost <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSL-1.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/jpsim/Yams">Yams <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>MIT</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/apple/swift-argument-parser">swift-argument-parser <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>Apache-2.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">Official Tiger-Code release <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>release terms</span></li></ul><p>Hufu is developed and maintained by syhily; the interface and document structure follow AIME (艾么输入法), an earlier project of the same author. Thanks to the Tiger-Code author, RIME and the open-source community.</p></section></div></main>
</Base>
